#. +> trunk stable
#: backupassistant.cpp:42
msgid "The backup can not be made. Either the mysqldump application is not installed, or the bzip2 application is not found. Please install those and make sure they can be found in the current path. Restart this Assistant when this is fixed."
msgstr "De Sekerheitkopie lett sik nich opstellen. Dat Programm \"mysqldump\" is nich installeert, oder dat Programm \"bzip2\" lett sik nich finnen. Installeer disse Programmen bitte un beseker, dat se sik över de PATH-Variabel finnen laat. Start dissen Hölper nieg, wenn Du dat richt hest."

#. +> trunk stable
#: backupassistant.cpp:47
msgid "Please select the file where to store the backup, give it the extension .tgz."
msgstr "Söök bitte de Datei ut, as de Du de Sekerheitkopie sekern wullt, un giff ehr de Verwiedern ».tgz«."

#. +> trunk stable
#: backupassistant.cpp:50
msgid "&Click here to select the Backup Location..."
msgstr "Steed för de Sekerheitkopie &utsöken..."

#. +> trunk stable
#: backupassistant.cpp:53
msgid "Press 'Next' to start the Backup"
msgstr "Klick op \"Nakamen\", wenn Du de Sekerheitkopie anfangen wullt"

#. +> trunk stable
#: backupassistant.cpp:57
msgid "Welcome to the Backup Assistant"
msgstr "Willkamen bi den Sekerheitkopie-Hölper"

#. +> trunk stable
#: backupassistant.cpp:62
msgid "Making the backup"
msgstr "De Sekerheitkopie warrt maakt"

#. +> trunk stable
#: backupassistant.cpp:83
msgid "Save As"
msgstr "Sekern as"

#. +> trunk stable
#: backupassistant.cpp:99
msgid "Please be patient, the backup is being created..."
msgstr "Tööv bitte, de Sekerheitkopie warrt opstellt..."

#. +> trunk stable
#: backupassistant.cpp:106
msgid "The backup has been made. Please verify manually if the backup is complete. Also note that KWallet stored passwords are not in the backup, you might want to verify you have a backup of those elsewhere."
msgstr "De Sekerheitkopie wöör maakt. Prööv bitte vun Hand, wat allens dor is. Beacht bitte, binnen KWallet, de elektroonsche Knipp, wohrte Passwöör sünd nich binnen de Sekerheitkopie. Kiek bitte, wat Du en Kopie dorvun annerwarts hest."

#. +> trunk stable
#: backupassistant.cpp:112
msgid "The backup process ended unexpectedly. Please report a bug, so we can find out what the cause is."
msgstr "Dat Koperen hett unverwachtens ophollen. Sett bitte en Fehlerbericht op, so dat wi rutfinnen köönt, wat de Grund is."

